# MLflow local tracking store — mlflow.db is a SQLite DB of run history
# (params/metrics/tags); mlruns/ still holds the actual logged files
# (plots, checkpoints, the logged model) even though MLflow 3.x moved
# params/metrics out of the old mlruns/-as-everything file store.
mlflow.db
mlruns/

